: 0px; margin: 0px; border-style: solid; height: 40px; width: 150px; background-color: rgb(255, 214, 112); color: rgb(27, 38, 74); border-color: rgb(232, 168, 56); border-width: 2px; font-family: Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; position: absolute; left: 85px; top: 397px; border-radius: 0px;\">New story</button></div></div>",
